---
---

<section class="solution section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="solution-header">
      <span class="section-label animate-in" data-i18n="solution.label">The Answer</span>
      <h2 class="animate-in" data-i18n="solution.title">
        Movement that adapts<br/>to your life.
      </h2>
      <p class="solution-intro animate-in" data-i18n="solution.intro">
        diamo learns how you feel, builds your day accordingly, and connects you with women who move in real life. Three principles. One system.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Principle 1: Personalized -->
    <div class="solution-block animate-in" id="sol-personalized">
      <div class="solution-block-text">
        <div class="solution-num">01</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="solution.s1.title">It starts with you.</h3>
        <p data-i18n="solution.s1.desc">
          30 seconds each morning: How did you sleep? How's your energy? diamo takes your body signals — sleep, heart rate, cycle phase, and daily energy — and builds a workout that fits right now. Not yesterday. Not a template. Today.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="solution-block-visual">
        <div class="solution-phone">
          <img src="/screenshots/onboarding-1.png" alt="diamo daily check-in" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="solution-phone solution-phone--back">
          <img src="/screenshots/home-insights.png" alt="diamo body insights" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Principle 2: Adaptive -->
    <div class="solution-block solution-block--reverse animate-in" id="sol-adaptive">
      <div class="solution-block-text">
        <div class="solution-num">02</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="solution.s2.title">Your plan moves with you.</h3>
        <p data-i18n="solution.s2.desc">
          Strength, endurance, mobility, or recovery — diamo selects the right module for today based on your readiness. Missed a session? It adapts. Had a great night's sleep? Time to push. No guilt. No rigid schedules.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="solution-block-visual">
        <div class="solution-phone">
          <img src="/screenshots/calendar-weekly.png" alt="diamo adaptive calendar" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="solution-phone solution-phone--back">
          <img src="/screenshots/home-training.png" alt="diamo training plan" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Principle 3: Community -->
    <div class="solution-block animate-in" id="sol-community">
      <div class="solution-block-text">
        <div class="solution-num">03</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="solution.s3.title">Off the screen, into real life.</h3>
        <p data-i18n="solution.s3.desc">
          Training alone lasts 3 months. Training together lasts a lifetime. Find running groups, local studios, and events near you. Join challenges with real women. No feed, no comparison — just showing up.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="solution-block-visual">
        <div class="solution-phone">
          <img src="/screenshots/home-workout.png" alt="diamo community features" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="solution-phone solution-phone--back">
          <img src="/screenshots/community.png" alt="diamo local events" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .solution {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .solution-header {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .solution-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .solution-intro {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  /* ─── Block layout ─── */
  .solution-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .solution-block:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .solution-block--reverse {
    direction: rtl;
  }
  .solution-block--reverse > * {
    direction: ltr;
  }

  .solution-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--navy);
    opacity: 0.08;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .solution-block-text h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .solution-block-text p {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  /* ─── Phone duo ─── */
  .solution-block-visual {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  .solution-phone {
    width: clamp(200px, 20vw, 260px);
    border-radius: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-phone);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .solution-phone img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .solution-phone--back {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0.7;
    transform: scale(0.92) translateX(30px);
    width: clamp(180px, 18vw, 240px);
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ─── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .solution-block,
    .solution-block--reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      direction: ltr;
      text-align: center;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }

    .solution-block-text p {
      max-width: none;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .solution-block-visual {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .solution-phone { width: 220px; }
    .solution-phone--back { display: none; }

    .solution-header {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: none;
    }
    .solution-header p {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
